{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1063879/block/singleImage/3267701/wm/01M7FBZPXCQDPCDBJ2KMNPTW3W.jpg?updatedAt=1794740650\"/><figcaption>牛頭角下邨。(資料圖片)</figcaption></figure><p>牛頭角發生盜竊案。一名41歲賴姓女子今日上午11時55分報案指，其牛頭角下邨貴輝樓寓所內一批約值50萬元的金器及31萬元現金不翼而飛。 警方初步調查後將案件列盜竊，交由秀茂坪警區刑事調查隊第五隊跟進，暫未有人被捕。據悉，涉案現金有部分為外幣，包括日圓、韓圜及人民幣。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T11:40:04.075314+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":146,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T10:31:55+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T18:39:19.718944+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T11:33:51.497134+00:00","content_hash":"42d3aabfe75d43d59e5ee5a3502b81e223a4790cff386b951a01650a3ef5ba28","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}